{"id": "47361", "title": "废都", "author": "贾平凹", "category": "都市言情", "count": 25, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/47/47361.htm", "intro": "《废都》中，贾平凹写出了一部社会风俗史，以主人公庄之蝶为中心巧妙地组织人物关系。围绕着庄之蝶的四位女性——牛月清、唐宛儿、柳月、阿灿是小说中着墨最多的。她们分别是不同经历、不同层次的女性，每个人的际遇、心理都展示着社会文化的一个侧面。但是这本书遭到了毁誉两极的争议，誉之者称为奇书，毁之者视为坏书。", "base": "files/article/html/47/47361", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "6412056.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "6412057.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "6412058.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "6412059.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "6412060.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "6412061.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "6412062.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "6412063.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "6412064.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "6412065.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "6412066.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "6412067.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "6412069.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "6412070.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "6412071.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "6412072.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "6412073.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "6412074.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "6412075.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "6412076.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "6412077.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "6412078.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "6412079.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章", "file": "6412080.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十五章（结局）", "file": "641208